# Seasons on the look path at climate borders (QA7 V7-004, V7-008, V7-005, V7-006): a border's
# band keeps the season's own looks outside the snowy season (Naqsh-e Rostam's peak is bare rock
# in July, not its plain snowy cone), and a blend never carries snow onto land whose climate has
# none (Babylon in January). Shots of the Susiana coast's band in April and of snow at the line.
set chatter quiet
set weather clear
set time 0.2
set season summer
set day 4
set world 314 131 1
wait 40
expect luma 130,640,100,120 0 135
shot shots/look_seasons_naqsh_july.png
set season spring
set day 1
set world 402 178 1
wait 40
shot shots/look_seasons_susiana_april.png
set season winter
set day 10
set world 300 226 1
wait 40
expect luma 0,300,200,200 100 135
shot shots/look_seasons_babylon_january.png
set world 223 908 1
wait 40
shot shots/look_seasons_apennines_january.png
quit
